{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XrdFranBUHNtSdfGojDzcj","type":"tool_result","content":"0\t- index: 0\n1\t  title: srd002-sys -- pkg/sys (contract)\n2\t  description: |\n3\t    deliverable_type: code\n4\t\n5\t    required_reading:\n6\t      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd002-sys.yaml (full SRD for pkg/sys)\n7\t      - CLAUDE.md (SIGPIPE handling pattern and project conventions)\n8\t\n9\t    files:\n10\t      - path: pkg/sys/fileinfo.go\n11\t        action: create\n12\t        note: FileInfo struct and Stat/Lstat function stubs\n13\t      - path: pkg/sys/terminal.go\n14\t        action: create\n15\t        note: TerminalWidth and IsTerminal function stubs\n16\t      - path: pkg/sys/signal.go\n17\t        action: create\n18\t        note: InstallSIGPIPEHandler and OnTerminalResize function stubs\n19\t\n20\t    requirements:\n21\t      - id: R1\n22\t        text: \"Define FileInfo struct with fields: Mode os.FileMode, Size int64, Nlink uint64, Uid uint32, Gid uint32, Rdev uint64, Dev uint64, Ino uint64, Blocks int64, Blksize int64, ModTime time.Time, AccessTime time.Time, ChangeTime time.Time, Info os.FileInfo\"\n23\t      - id: R2\n24\t        text: \"Define file metadata function signatures as stubs: Stat(path string) (*FileInfo, error), Lstat(path string) (*FileInfo, error)\"\n25\t      - id: R3\n26\t        text: \"Define terminal function signatures as stubs: TerminalWidth() (int, error), IsTerminal(fd uintptr) bool\"\n27\t      - id: R4\n28\t        text: \"Define signal function signatures as stubs: InstallSIGPIPEHandler(), OnTerminalResize(callback func(width int))\"\n29\t\n30\t    design_decisions:\n31\t      - id: D1\n32\t        text: \"Split exports across three files by domain: fileinfo.go (struct and stat functions), terminal.go (terminal queries), signal.go (signal handlers)\"\n33\t      - id: D2\n34\t        text: \"Package must not import any cmd/ package or any other pkg/ package\"\n35\t      - id: D3\